{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Ada4R5eHaNs2nWMx9GPgDg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Lock file is empty. I have all the information needed from the experiment plan and registry. Let me now generate the comprehensive predictions.\n\n```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  2-axis framework（connector coupling × task complexity）在所有 model×suite 组合中得到干净验证。\n  CV diagnostic 形成完整的连续预测谱（0.038→0.314），scaling law 在 k=0.5 和 k=0.7 均成立且无例外。\n  π0.5 uniformly critical 行为（L2norm 高原 + random cliff）泛化至 Spatial/Goal/Long，机制一致。\n  VTR connector-dependency（pixel-shuffle 有效、MLP 失败）是干净且可解释的结果。\n  E5 attention pruning 在 Goal suite 上完美泛化（SR=96.8-98.2%），为 entangling connector 提供\n  \"correct importance metric rescues\" 叙事。5 claims 全部保留，reviewer concern RC7 被 4 suites 完全化解。\n  Paper title 不变。叙事核心：Analysis（primary）+ Diagnose-then-Compress method（secondary）。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 1. c4_learned_reencoding_smolvla (in_progress → effectively complete)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"VTR M-sweep tri-seed completion (SmolVLA)\"\n    plan_id: \"c4_learned_reencoding_smolvla\"\n    description: >\n      SmolVLA VTR cross-attention M=16/32/64/96/128 全部 3-seed 完成。\n      MLP adapter M=32 3-seed 完成。M-curve 平坦性、架构独立性、near-lossless compression 已确认。\n      剩余工作：最终统计汇总与 paper table 生成。\n    expected_results:\n      m16_3seed_mean_sr: 56.9\n      m16_3seed_std: 1.3\n      m32_3seed_mean_sr: 60.1\n      m32_3seed_std: 1.3\n      m64_3seed_mean_sr: 62.0\n      m64_3seed_std: 2.3\n      m96_3seed_mean_sr: 54.5\n      m96_3seed_std: 3.2\n      m128_3seed_mean_sr: 58.0\n      m128_3seed_std: 3.5\n      mlp_adapter_m32_mean_sr: 63.4\n      mlp_adapter_m32_std: 2.6\n      vtr_recovery_ratio_m128: 0.98\n      m_curve_max_range_pp: 7.5\n      vtc_vs_mlp_pvalue: 0.15\n      baseline_sr: 59.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      M-curve 平坦的根本原因：pixel-shuffle 的空间折叠创造了可逆的 token 纠缠。VTR 的 cross-attention\n      学习了\"展开\"这种纠缠的映射——无论压缩到多少 query token（M=16→128），只要保留足够的 capacity\n      来表示空间结构，re-encoding 就能恢复。M=128 passthrough（58.0%）≈baseline（59.2%）证明\n      VTR 是恢复而非增强。MLP adapter 与 cross-attention 无显著差异（p=0.15）证明任何 learned \n      re-encoding 都能完成此恢复，不依赖特定架构机制。M=96 dip（p=0.034 vs M=64）是统计真实但\n      实际影响有限的波动（54.5% 仍远高于 0% hard pruning）。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: SmolVLA VTR M-sweep (3-seed)\"\n        columns: [\"M\", \"Compression\", \"SR mean±std (%)\", \"vs Baseline Δ (pp)\", \"p vs M=128\"]\n        data:\n          - [\"16\", \"87.5%\", \"56.9±1.3\", \"-2.3\", \">0.25\"]\n          - [\"32\", \"75%\", \"60.1±1.3\", \"+0.9\", \">0.25\"]\n          - [\"64\", \"50%\", \"62.0±2.3\", \"+2.8\", \">0.25\"]\n          - [\"96\", \"25%\", \"54.5±3.2\", \"-4.7\", \"0.034*\"]\n          - [\"128\", \"0% (passthrough)\", \"58.0±3.5\", \"-1.2\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"MLP-adapter@32\", \"75%\", \"63.4±2.6\", \"+4.2\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Hard pruning k=0.5\", \"50%\", \"0.0\", \"-59.2\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: M-curve flat plot — x=M (16→128), y=SR(%). Horizontal band at baseline 59.2%±5pp, all M values within band. Hard pruning 0% shown as contrast.\"\n    analysis: >\n      VTR 在 pixel-shuffle connector 上实现 near-lossless compression at ANY ratio（0-87.5%）。\n      这是 Claim 4 的核心证据。M=16 87.5% compression 仅损失 2.3pp，而 hard pruning 在 5% removal \n      即 collapse 至 0%。recovery ratio 0.98 落在 best tier 目标范围 [0.95, 1.05] 内。\n      架构独立性（VTC vs MLP p=0.15）排除了特定机制假说，支持\"任何 learned re-encoding 均可修复\n      pixel-shuffle entanglement\"的一般性结论。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 2. c4_ext_method_universality_openvla (in_progress)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"VTR on OpenVLA (MLP projector) — connector-dependent ceiling\"\n    plan_id: \"c4_ext_method_universality_openvla\"\n    description: >\n      VTR M=128 full training 已确认 0% SR（overfitting, 每步输出相同 action）。\n      VTC-only M=32/M=64 作为 fallback 继续训练。预测结果为 clean negative：\n      VTR 对 MLP projector 无效，VTR ceiling 取决于 connector 类型。\n    expected_results:\n      vtconly_m32_sr: 0.0\n      vtconly_m64_sr: 0.0\n      vtconly_m96_sr: 0.0\n      vtr_m128_sr: 0.0\n      openvla_baseline_sr: 74.0\n      failure_mode: \"overfitting — model outputs identical action per step\"\n      connector_dependency_confirmed: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      MLP projector tokens 已经是独立且有意义的（CV=0.215，信息分布在 token 间有分化）。\n      VTR 的 cross-attention 试图将这些已经 well-structured 的 token 重新编码为更少的 query \n      token，但这个重新编码过程引入了不必要的复杂性。MLP token 的信息是 per-token 局部化的，\n      与 pixel-shuffle token 的空间纠缠不同——后者的信息恢复 requires 全局 re-arrangement，\n      恰好是 VTR cross-attention 擅长的。对 MLP projector，简单的 hard pruning（k=0.5 仍有 \n      37.4% SR）比 VTR 更有效，因为保留的 token 仍然 individually meaningful。VTR 的 22M \n      额外参数在缺乏 spatial entanglement repair 目标时退化为纯噪声拟合器。\n      所有 M 值（32/64/96/128）均失败进一步证明这不是超参数问题而是架构兼容性问题。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: VTR connector-dependency summary\"\n        columns: [\"Connector\", \"Model\", \"CV\", \"Hard prune k=0.5 SR(%)\", \"VTR M=32 SR(%)\", \"VTR Δ vs prune (pp)\"]\n        data:\n          - [\"Pixel-shuffle\", \"SmolVLA\", \"0.314\", \"0.0\", \"60.1\", \"+60.1\"]\n          - [\"MLP (3-layer)\", \"OpenVLA\", \"0.215\", \"37.4\", \"0.0\", \"-37.4\"]\n          - [\"Linear+BART\", \"X-VLA\", \"0.151\", \"42.6(L2)/70.6(R)\", \"N/A\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: VTR recovery diagram — SmolVLA: 0%→60% (recovery), OpenVLA: 37%→0% (degradation). Visual contrast showing connector-dependent VTR ceiling.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Clean negative result 强化了 paper narrative：VTR 是 pixel-shuffle 的特解而非通用压缩方法。\n      这从 weakness 变为 strength——说明 Diagnose-then-Compress framework 的第一步（CV diagnostic）\n      是必要的，因为不同 connector 需要不同的 compression strategy。MLP projector 应用 simple \n      pruning（已有 graded degradation），pixel-shuffle 应用 VTR re-encoding。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 3. c4_ext_openvla_msweep (in_progress)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"OpenVLA VTC M-sweep training (M=32/64/96)\"\n    plan_id: \"c4_ext_openvla_msweep\"\n    description: >\n      OpenVLA VTC-only（无 backbone fine-tuning）M-sweep 训练。此前 M=96_v3 和 M=64_v3 \n      均报 failed/negative。预测所有 M 值均无法恢复 SR，与 c4_ext 一致。\n    expected_results:\n      m32_vtconly_sr: 0.0\n      m64_vtconly_sr: 0.0\n      m96_vtconly_sr: 0.0\n      training_loss_converges: true\n      eval_sr_zero: true\n      diagnosis: \"VTC learns to minimize training loss but does not transfer to closed-loop control\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      VTC-only 模式冻结了 backbone，仅训练 22M compressor 参数。对 MLP projector，\n      backbone 已经学习了 per-token semantically meaningful representations。VTC \n      强制将 256 个有独立语义的 token 映射到更少的 query token，丢失了 token-level \n      semantic granularity。训练 loss 收敛（因为 cross-attention 可以学习压缩映射）\n      但 closed-loop control 失败，因为 action prediction 依赖 fine-grained token \n      discrimination 而非 compressed summary。与 SmolVLA 不同，SmolVLA 的 pixel-shuffle \n      token 本身缺乏 individual semantics（每个 token 编码 32×32 pixel region），\n      VTR re-encoding 只需恢复 spatial structure 而非 semantic content。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      所有 M 值失败构成 c4_ext 的完整 ablation：VTR 的有效性严格绑定到 pixel-shuffle \n      connector 的空间纠缠修复功能。Paper 中作为 §5.3 \"Re-encoding mechanism\" 的\n      反面证据，说明 VTR 不是通用 token compressor。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 4. c1_xvla_threshold_localization (in_progress → effectively complete)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"X-VLA cliff threshold 3-seed localization\"\n    plan_id: \"c1_xvla_threshold_localization\"\n    description: >\n      X-VLA k=0.8 和 k=0.85 的 3-seed 精确定位已完成。\n      k=0.80=89.0±0.72pp, k=0.85=67.9±0.31pp。Non-monotonic recovery 确认。\n    expected_results:\n      k080_3seed_mean: 89.0\n      k080_3seed_std: 0.72\n      k085_3seed_mean: 67.9\n      k085_3seed_std: 0.31\n      nonmonotonic_gap_pp: 21.1\n      cliff_zone: \"k=0.82-0.87\"\n      deterministic_sd_below_1pp: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      BART encoder（12 层 transformer）在 42 tokens（k=0.85）时触发 length-dependent \n      interaction breakdown。42 tokens 是 BART 自注意力模式的临界密度——低于此密度，\n      BART 的 cross-token mixing 产生的依赖链被截断，导致 cascading information loss。\n      40 tokens（k=0.8）反而恢复，因为 token 密度进一步降低使 BART 退化为 \n      near-independent processing（类似纯 linear projection 行为）。SD<1pp 证明这是 \n      完全 deterministic 的架构属性，非随机效应。3-seed 一致性消除了训练 seed 混淆因素。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: X-VLA cliff localization (L2norm, 3-seed)\"\n        columns: [\"k\", \"Tokens kept\", \"Seed 42\", \"Seed 43\", \"Seed 44\", \"Mean±SD\"]\n        data:\n          - [\"0.90\", \"45\", \"97.6\", \"98.2\", \"99.4\", \"98.4±0.9\"]\n          - [\"0.85\", \"42\", \"68.0\", \"67.6\", \"68.2\", \"67.9±0.3\"]\n          - [\"0.80\", \"40\", \"88.8\", \"88.4\", \"89.8\", \"89.0±0.7\"]\n          - [\"0.70\", \"35\", \"56.2\", \"58.2\", \"56.4\", \"56.9±1.1\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: X-VLA pruning curve with cliff zone highlighted. k=0.85 dip (67.9%) below k=0.8 (89.0%) creating non-monotonic pattern. Error bars from 3-seed.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cliff 定位精确到 k=0.82-0.87 区间。Non-monotonicity 是 BART encoder 的 emergent \n      property：存在一个 critical token density 使得 BART self-attention 的 cross-token \n      mixing 恰好最大化 information cascading damage。Paper figure 将此作为 \n      token-entangling connector 的典型特征展示。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 5. diagnostic_oft_cv (in_progress → effectively complete)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"OFT token importance CV measurement\"\n    plan_id: \"diagnostic_oft_cv\"\n    description: >\n      OpenVLA-OFT CV 已从 openvla_entropy_real 和 analysis 中确认为 0.219。\n      Entropy=0.667≈Standard(0.661)。完成 5/5 model diagnostic table。\n    expected_results:\n      oft_cv: 0.219\n      oft_entropy: 0.667\n      standard_openvla_cv: 0.215\n      cv_delta_oft_vs_standard: 0.004\n      entropy_delta: 0.006\n      connector_determines_attention: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      OFT 与 Standard OpenVLA 共享相同的 3-layer MLP connector（DINOv2+SigLIP fusion \n      仅增加输入通道但不改变 MLP mixing 结构）。Action head 差异（OFT diffusion vs \n      Standard autoregressive）不影响 vision token attention 分布，因为 attention \n      pattern 由 connector 在 vision-LLM 接口处决定，action head 在 LLM output 端操作。\n      CV 0.219≈0.215 差异在 noise level（<0.01），证明 connector 是 attention structure \n      的唯一决定因素。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: Complete 6-model diagnostic spectrum\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Connector\", \"Params\", \"Tokens\", \"Entropy\", \"CV\", \"Pruning Class\"]\n        data:\n          - [\"pi0\", \"Pure linear\", \"3.3B\", \"256\", \"0.959\", \"0.038\", \"Immune\"]\n          - [\"pi0.5\", \"Pure linear (x sqrt_d)\", \"4B\", \"768\", \"~0.67\", \"0.055\", \"Uniformly Critical\"]\n          - [\"X-VLA\", \"Linear+BART 12L\", \"880M\", \"50\", \"0.614\", \"0.151\", \"Threshold-graded\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"3-layer MLP\", \"7B\", \"256\", \"0.661\", \"0.215\", \"Smooth graded\"]\n          - [\"OFT\", \"3-layer MLP (DINOv2+SigLIP)\", \"7B\", \"512\", \"0.667\", \"0.219\", \"Smooth graded (expected)\"]\n          - [\"SmolVLA\", \"Pixel-shuffle 16x\", \"450M\", \"128\", \"0.952\", \"0.314\", \"Catastrophic\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      6-model diagnostic table 完整化。CV 连续谱 0.038→0.314 无间断地预测 pruning tolerance。\n      OFT entry 作为 action head 对照实验消除了\"action head 影响 pruning\"的替代假说。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 6. c6_libero_suite_expansion (in_progress)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Cross-suite 2-axis framework validation (5 models × 4 suites)\"\n    plan_id: \"c6_libero_suite_expansion\"\n    description: >\n      5 models × 4 LIBERO suites × 2 methods（L2norm/random）全矩阵填充。\n      已收集绝大部分数据。剩余：OpenVLA Spatial random k=0.9, OpenVLA Long L2norm/random k=0.9,\n      部分 OpenVLA attention cross-suite。预测所有剩余数据点与 2-axis framework 一致。\n    expected_results:\n      # Axis-2 amplification (entangling connectors)\n      xvla_object_k09_sr: 97.6\n      xvla_goal_k09_sr: 70.2\n      xvla_long_k09_sr: 27.5\n      xvla_amplification_object_to_goal_pp: 27.4\n      xvla_amplification_object_to_long_pp: 70.1\n      # Axis-2 amplification (independent connectors)\n      pi05_l2norm_object_k09_sr: 98.2\n      pi05_l2norm_goal_k09_sr: 90.6\n      pi05_l2norm_long_k09_sr: 81.0\n      pi05_amplification_object_to_goal_pp: 7.6\n      pi05_amplification_object_to_long_pp: 17.2\n      # OpenVLA remaining predictions\n      openvla_spatial_random_k09_sr: 67.0\n      openvla_long_l2norm_k09_sr: 46.0\n      openvla_long_random_k09_sr: 43.0\n      # SmolVLA cross-suite (all zero)\n      smolvla_spatial_k095_sr: 0.0\n      smolvla_goal_k095_sr: 0.0\n      smolvla_long_k095_sr: 0.0\n      # Framework accuracy\n      cross_suite_framework_accuracy_pct: 95\n      axis2_amplification_entangling_min_pp: 27.4\n      axis2_amplification_independent_max_pp: 17.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      Axis-2（task complexity）放大效应的机制：complex tasks（Goal/Long）要求 multi-step \n      reasoning，每一步的 action prediction 依赖前一步保留的 spatial information。\n      Token-entangling connectors（BART/pixel-shuffle）的 pruning damage 在 multi-step \n      中 compound——单步小损失在序列中累积为大损失。Token-independent connectors（linear/MLP）\n      的 pruning damage 是 per-step 局部的，不会 cascade。\n      \n      具体预测依据：\n      - X-VLA Object→Goal 27.4pp 已确认（same k=0.9, same method, only task differs）\n      - X-VLA Object→Long 更大（70.1pp）因为 Long 任务平均 horizon 更长，compounding 更严重\n      - π0.5 L2norm Object→Goal 仅 7.6pp（low CV 使得 L2norm 选择的 token 在 spatial \n        coverage 上已近最优，task complexity 无法放大 spatial coverage 的已有优势）\n      - π0.5 Object→Long 17.2pp 稍大，但仍 <20pp（independent connector 上限）\n      \n      OpenVLA 剩余预测：\n      - Spatial random k=0.9≈67%：OpenVLA Spatial baseline=80%, L2norm k=0.9=75%。\n        Random 通常比 L2norm 低 5-8pp（CV=0.215 使 L2norm 有轻微优势）\n      - Long L2norm k=0.9≈46%：Long baseline=52.8%, 相对保留率≈OpenVLA Object pattern\n      - Long random k=0.9≈43%：随机稍差于 L2norm（high CV）\n      \n      SmolVLA 全 suite 0%：pixel-shuffle 纠缠在任何 task distribution 下都导致 catastrophic \n      failure。Spatial/Goal 的 baseline 较低（44.6%/60.8%）不影响 cliff-edge——即使 baseline \n      更低，k=0.95 pruning 仍然 collapse 至 0%。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: 2-Axis Framework — Axis-2 amplification at k=0.9 (L2norm)\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"CV\", \"Connector\", \"Object SR(%)\", \"Spatial SR(%)\", \"Goal SR(%)\", \"Long SR(%)\", \"Amplif O→G (pp)\"]\n        data:\n          - [\"pi0.5\", \"0.055\", \"Linear\", \"98.2\", \"95.0\", \"90.6\", \"81.0\", \"7.6\"]\n          - [\"X-VLA\", \"0.151\", \"Lin+BART\", \"97.6\", \"78.8\", \"70.2\", \"27.5\", \"27.4\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"0.215\", \"MLP\", \"70.6\", \"75.0\", \"74.8\", \"46.0\", \"-4.2*\"]\n          - [\"SmolVLA\", \"0.314\", \"Pix-shuf\", \"0.0\", \"0.0\", \"0.0\", \"0.0\", \"N/A\"]\n      - title: \"Table: Cross-suite pruning sensitivity heatmap (SR at k=0.5, random)\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Object\", \"Spatial\", \"Goal\", \"Long\"]\n        data:\n          - [\"pi0.5\", \"69.4 (68.9†)\", \"71.6\", \"73.6\", \"46.8\"]\n          - [\"X-VLA\", \"70.6 (70.3†)\", \"71.4\", \"67.9†\", \"61.6\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"35.8\", \"~36\", \"52.2\", \"~35\"]\n          - [\"SmolVLA\", \"0.0\", \"0.6\", \"0.0\", \"0.0\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 2-axis heatmap — rows=models (sorted by CV), columns=suites (sorted by complexity). Color=SR at k=0.9. Clear gradient: entangling connectors show steep color change across suites, independent connectors show mild change.\"\n      - \"Fig: Amplification bar chart — grouped bars per model showing Object→Goal SR drop (pp). X-VLA 27.4pp tower vs π0.5 7.6pp bar. Horizontal line at 20pp separating entangling/independent zones.\"\n    analysis: >\n      2-axis framework 在 95% 的 model×suite cells 中正确预测 pruning outcome。\n      唯一的 partial exception：OpenVLA Goal k=0.9 SR（74.8%）高于 Object k=0.9（70.6%），\n      但这是 baseline difference（Goal baseline 74.8% = Object baseline 74%），相对 \n      degradation 是一致的。Framework accuracy 95% 落在 best tier 范围 [90, 100] 内。\n      \n      Key axis-2 interaction：entangling connectors 放大倍数 27.4pp（X-VLA Object→Goal）\n      落在 best tier 范围 [25, 45] 内。Independent connectors 保持 ≤10pp（π0.5 7.6pp）\n      符合假设。Long suite 的更大放大（X-VLA 70.1pp, π0.5 17.2pp）与 horizon length \n      正相关，进一步验证 compounding damage 机制。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 7. c6_libero_suite_vtr (planned)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"VTR cross-suite generalization (SmolVLA Long)\"\n    plan_id: \"c6_libero_suite_vtr\"\n    description: >\n      SmolVLA VTR M=32 已在 Spatial（53.2%）和 Goal（56.4%）验证。\n      剩余：Long suite（baseline 36.6%）的 VTR recovery。\n      预测 M=32 Long≈33-38%，完成 Diagnose-then-Compress 全 suite 验证。\n    expected_results:\n      smolvla_long_baseline_sr: 36.6\n      smolvla_long_hard_prune_k05_sr: 0.0\n      smolvla_long_hard_prune_k095_sr: 0.0\n      vtr_m32_long_sr: 35.5\n      vtr_m32_long_ci95_lower: 31.0\n      vtr_m32_long_ci95_upper: 40.0\n      vtr_m32_spatial_sr: 53.2\n      vtr_m32_goal_sr: 56.4\n      vtr_m32_object_sr: 60.1\n      recovery_ratio_long: 0.97\n      cross_suite_recovery_consistent: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      VTR cross-suite recovery ratio 预测≈0.97（35.5/36.6）：\n      \n      1. M-curve 平坦性在 Object suite 已确认——VTR 的 re-encoding 修复 spatial \n         entanglement，这是 connector-level 属性，与 task distribution 无关。\n      2. Spatial recovery 53.2%/43.8%=1.21 和 Goal recovery 56.4%/60.8%=0.93 \n         显示 cross-suite recovery ratio 围绕 1.0 波动（±20%），中位数 ≈1.0。\n      3. Long suite baseline 较低（36.6% vs Object 59.2%）因为 Long 任务本身更难，\n         但 VTR 不应额外降低——它只修复 pruning damage，不影响 task difficulty。\n      4. Long 的稍低 recovery（预测 0.97）可能源于 Long horizon 放大了 VTR \n         re-encoding 中的微小信息损失，但效果应 <5pp。\n      \n      VTR 在 Long 上仍将远超 hard pruning（35.5% vs 0%），完成全 4 suites 的 \n      \"recovery from cliff-edge\" 证据链。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: VTR M=32 cross-suite recovery\"\n        columns: [\"Suite\", \"Baseline SR(%)\", \"Hard prune k=0.5 SR(%)\", \"VTR M=32 SR(%)\", \"Recovery ratio\"]\n        data:\n          - [\"Object\", \"59.2\", \"0.0\", \"60.1\", \"1.015\"]\n          - [\"Spatial\", \"43.8*\", \"0.6\", \"53.2\", \"1.21*\"]\n          - [\"Goal\", \"60.8*\", \"0.0\", \"56.4\", \"0.93\"]\n          - [\"Long\", \"36.6\", \"0.0\", \"35.5 (pred)\", \"0.97 (pred)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: VTR recovery bar chart — 4 suites side by side, each showing baseline (gray), hard prune (red, near 0), VTR M=32 (green, near baseline). Consistent recovery pattern across all suites.\"\n    analysis: >\n      VTR cross-suite generalization证明 re-encoding 修复的是 architectural entanglement \n      而非 task-specific information。Recovery ratio ≈1.0 across 4 suites 支持 Claim 4：\n      \"Learned Re-Encoding Achieves Near-Lossless Compression Where Deletion Fails\"。\n      vtr_smolvla_recovery_ratio 0.97 落在 best tier 范围 [0.95, 1.05] 内。\n      \n      对 practitioner 的 implication：使用 pixel-shuffle connector 的 VLA 可以通过 \n      VTR 实现任意压缩比而无显著 SR 损失。22M 额外参数 + 6% latency overhead 是可接受的代价。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 8. c1_pi05_immune_confirmation (planned → effectively complete via registry)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"π0.5 uniformly critical behavior cross-suite validation\"\n    plan_id: \"c1_pi05_immune_confirmation\"\n    description: >\n      π0.5（4B, PaliGemma linear proj）已完成 4 suites baseline + 全面 pruning sweep。\n      CV=0.055 confirmed。L2norm plateau（k≥0.85 maintains ≥98% Object, ≥88% Spatial/Goal）\n      和 random cliff（k=0.85-0.925 Object collapse）均已 multi-seed 验证。\n      Scaling law extreme（Δ(R-L2)=+36pp at k=0.5）confirmed。\n      剩余工作：Cross-suite 一致性最终确认 + paper narrative 整合。\n    expected_results:\n      # Baselines (confirmed)\n      baseline_object: 98.2\n      baseline_spatial: 97.2\n      baseline_goal: 96.4\n      baseline_long: 92.8\n      cv: 0.055\n      # L2norm plateau (confirmed)\n      l2norm_k095_object: 98.2\n      l2norm_k09_object: 98.2\n      l2norm_k085_object: 98.0\n      l2norm_k095_spatial: 97.8\n      l2norm_k09_spatial: 95.0\n      l2norm_k085_spatial: 88.6\n      l2norm_k095_goal: 90.8\n      l2norm_k09_goal: 90.6\n      l2norm_k085_goal: 88.0\n      l2norm_k095_long: 87.0\n      l2norm_k09_long: 81.0\n      l2norm_k085_long: 78.4\n      # Random cliff (confirmed)\n      random_k095_object: 74.0\n      random_k0925_object: 27.6\n      random_k09_object: 9.0\n      random_k085_object: 5.0\n      random_k095_spatial: 76.4\n      random_k0925_spatial: 58.2\n      random_k09_spatial: 54.6\n      random_k085_spatial: 60.2\n      random_k095_goal: 83.8\n      random_k0925_goal: 70.0\n      random_k09_goal: 62.2\n      random_k085_goal: 52.4\n      random_k095_long: 63.2\n      random_k09_long: 31.8\n      random_k085_long: 45.2\n      # Scaling law contribution\n      l2norm_k05_object: 33.4\n      random_k05_object: 69.4\n      gap_R_minus_L2_k05_pp: 36.0\n      # Cross-suite L2norm/random gap at k=0.5\n      l2norm_k05_spatial: 55.6\n      random_k05_spatial: 71.6\n      gap_spatial_k05_pp: 16.0\n      l2norm_k05_goal: 59.8\n      random_k05_goal: 73.6\n      gap_goal_k05_pp: 13.8\n      l2norm_k05_long: 50.2\n      random_k05_long: 46.8\n      gap_long_k05_pp: -3.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      π0.5 \"uniformly critical\" 行为的 cross-suite 一致性验证了 Claim 1 和 Claim 5：\n      \n      1. **L2norm plateau 跨 suite 一致**：k≥0.85 时 L2norm 在所有 4 suites 维持高 SR\n         （Object 98%, Spatial 88.6%, Goal 88%, Long 78.4%）。Plateau 随 task complexity \n         轻微下降但保持>78%。机制：L2norm 的 deterministic selection 保留 spatial coverage，\n         low CV（0.055）使选中的 token subset 具有 near-uniform importance，覆盖度好。\n      \n      2. **Random cliff 跨 suite 差异化**：\n         - Object cliff dramatic（74→28→9→5%），因为 Object tasks 有 concentrated critical \n           tokens（object identity discrimination 依赖 specific patches）\n         - Spatial cliff milder（76→58→55→60%），因为 spatial layout information 是 \n           distributed 的，random removal 不会完全摧毁 spatial signal\n         - Goal cliff moderate（84→70→62→52%），因为 Goal tasks 混合了 spatial 和 \n           semantic disambiguation\n         - Long cliff steep（63→32→45%），因为 long-horizon compounding 放大了 random \n           token loss\n      \n      3. **Scaling law（Δ(R-L2)）cross-suite 演变**：\n         - Object k=0.5: +36.0pp（random wins massively, extreme of scaling law）\n         - Spatial k=0.5: +16.0pp（random wins, spatial distributed info helps random）\n         - Goal k=0.5: +13.8pp（random wins, similar to spatial）\n         - Long k=0.5: -3.4pp（L2norm slightly wins — long horizon 使 L2norm 的 \n           deterministic consistency 成为优势，random 的 per-step variance compounds）\n         \n         Gap 从 +36→+16→+14→-3.4 的变化不违反 scaling law：scaling law 是 \n         cross-model（CV drives direction），不是 cross-suite。Suite 影响 gap \n         magnitude 但不改变 sign（除 Long 的轻微 reversal，可解释为 horizon effect）。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: π0.5 L2norm plateau cross-suite\"\n        columns: [\"k\", \"Object\", \"Spatial\", \"Goal\", \"Long\"]\n        data:\n          - [\"1.0 (baseline)\", \"98.2\", \"97.2\", \"96.4\", \"92.8\"]\n          - [\"0.95\", \"98.2\", \"97.8\", \"90.8\", \"87.0\"]\n          - [\"0.925\", \"99.2\", \"97.0\", \"89.8\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"0.9\", \"98.2\", \"95.0\", \"90.6\", \"81.0\"]\n          - [\"0.85\", \"98.0\", \"88.6\", \"88.0\", \"78.4\"]\n          - [\"0.7\", \"55.0\", \"67.0\", \"73.6\", \"62.6\"]\n          - [\"0.5\", \"33.4\", \"55.6\", \"59.8\", \"50.2\"]\n          - [\"0.3\", \"51.0\", \"57.2\", \"50.6\", \"36.6\"]\n      - title: \"Table: π0.5 random cliff cross-suite\"\n        columns: [\"k\", \"Object\", \"Spatial\", \"Goal\", \"Long\"]\n        data:\n          - [\"0.95\", \"74.0\", \"76.4\", \"83.8\", \"63.2\"]\n          - [\"0.925\", \"27.6\", \"58.2\", \"70.0\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"0.9\", \"9.0\", \"54.6\", \"62.2\", \"31.8\"]\n          - [\"0.85\", \"5.0\", \"60.2\", \"52.4\", \"45.2\"]\n          - [\"0.7\", \"75.5\", \"74.4\", \"75.6\", \"65.8\"]\n          - [\"0.5\", \"69.4\", \"71.6\", \"73.6\", \"46.8\"]\n          - [\"0.3\", \"36.4\", \"43.4\", \"52.8\", \"29.6\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: π0.5 L2norm vs random pruning curves, 4 suites side-by-side. L2norm plateau vs random cliff contrast. Object cliff most dramatic, Spatial most resilient.\"\n      - \"Fig: Concentrated vs distributed critical tokens illustration — Object tasks show localized critical patches, Spatial tasks show diffuse importance.\"\n    analysis: >\n      π0.5 完整 cross-suite 数据确认了核心假设 3：uniformly critical behavior \n      generalize 至 Spatial/Goal，且机制一致（concentrated vs distributed critical tokens \n      决定 cliff severity）。pi05_l2norm_random_gap_k05_pp=36.0pp 落在 best tier \n      范围 [30, 40] 内。\n      \n      π0.5 是 scaling law 的 extreme point（CV=0.055, 最低），在所有 suite 上都展现\n      L2norm catastrophic failure at aggressive compression。这强化了 \"CV predicts optimal \n      pruning strategy\" narrative——对 low-CV models，importance-based pruning actively harmful。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 9. c3_oft_graded_full (planned)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"OpenVLA-OFT graded degradation cross-suite validation\"\n    plan_id: \"c3_oft_graded_full\"\n    description: >\n      OFT（7B, 3-layer MLP, DINOv2+SigLIP fusion, 512 tokens）在兼容硬件（A100+torch2.2）\n      上进行 4 suites baseline + pruning 评估。CV=0.219≈OpenVLA(0.215) 预测相同的 \n      graded degradation 模式。此实验验证 action head（OFT vs Standard）不影响 pruning behavior。\n    expected_results:\n      # Baselines (from official reports)\n      baseline_object: 97.0\n      baseline_spatial: 95.0\n      baseline_goal: 96.0\n      baseline_long: 85.0\n      # L2norm pruning (predicted from OpenVLA retention ratios)\n      l2norm_k095_object: 91.0\n      l2norm_k09_object: 83.0\n      l2norm_k07_object: 65.0\n      l2norm_k05_object: 50.0\n      l2norm_k03_object: 28.0\n      # Random pruning (predicted)\n      random_k095_object: 90.0\n      random_k09_object: 80.0\n      random_k07_object: 60.0\n      random_k05_object: 46.0\n      random_k03_object: 25.0\n      # L2norm vs random gap (high CV → L2norm slightly better)\n      gap_R_minus_L2_k05_object_pp: -4.0\n      gap_R_minus_L2_k07_object_pp: -5.0\n      # Cross-suite at k=0.9\n      l2norm_k09_spatial: 82.0\n      l2norm_k09_goal: 84.0\n      l2norm_k09_long: 68.0\n      # CV and entropy\n      cv: 0.219\n      entropy: 0.667\n    result_rationale: >\n      OFT 使用与 Standard OpenVLA 相同的 3-layer MLP connector。CV 0.219≈0.215 的高度一致性\n      预测几乎相同的 pruning degradation pattern：\n      \n      1. **Graded degradation 预测**：OpenVLA relative retention at k=0.5 = 37.4/74 = 50.5%。\n         OFT baseline 更高（~97%），absolute SR 更高但 relative pattern 一致。\n         预测 OFT k=0.5 L2norm ≈ 97×0.515 ≈ 50%。\n      \n      2. **L2norm > random 一致**：high CV（0.219）= meaningful importance differentiation → \n         L2norm selection effective。预测 L2norm 在所有 k 值优于 random 3-6pp，\n         与 OpenVLA pattern（+1.4 to +5.4pp）一致。\n      \n      3. **Cross-suite pattern**：OFT 的 512 tokens（vs OpenVLA 256）提供更高的信息冗余，\n         可能使 pruning tolerance 略高于 OpenVLA。但 connector mechanism 相同，\n         degradation shape 应一致（smooth graded）。\n      \n      4. **Action head 独立性**：OFT diffusion action head 和 Standard autoregressive \n         action head 对 pruning 的反应应 identical，因为 pruning 发生在 vision-LLM \n         接口而非 action decode 阶段。这是 connector-determines-pruning 假说的关键证据。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: OFT vs OpenVLA pruning comparison (Object suite, L2norm)\"\n        columns: [\"k\", \"OFT SR(%) (pred)\", \"OpenVLA SR(%)\", \"OFT retention\", \"OpenVLA retention\"]\n        data:\n          - [\"1.0\", \"97.0\", \"74.0\", \"100%\", \"100%\"]\n          - [\"0.95\", \"91.0\", \"69.4\", \"93.8%\", \"93.8%\"]\n          - [\"0.9\", \"83.0\", \"62.0\", \"85.6%\", \"83.8%\"]\n          - [\"0.7\", \"65.0\", \"49.0\", \"67.0%\", \"66.2%\"]\n          - [\"0.5\", \"50.0\", \"37.4\", \"51.5%\", \"50.5%\"]\n          - [\"0.3\", \"28.0\", \"20.6\", \"28.9%\", \"27.8%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: OFT vs OpenVLA pruning curves overlaid, normalized by baseline. Near-identical relative degradation pattern despite different baselines and action heads.\"\n    analysis: >\n      OFT 实验是 paper 中消除 confound 的关键 ablation：same connector + different action head \n      → same pruning behavior，证明 connector 是 causal factor。如果 Blackwell GPU \n      兼容性问题无法解决，OFT 可以仅通过 CV/entropy analysis（已完成）纳入 paper，\n      辅以 official baseline 引用。LIBERO eval 是 bonus（icing on the cake），\n      CV/entropy 已足够支持 Claim。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 10. c5_third_connector_roboflamingo (planned)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Perceiver Resampler connector fine-tune + pruning\"\n    plan_id: \"c5_third_connector_roboflamingo\"\n    description: >\n      RoboFlamingo（Perceiver Resampler: 64 learned query tokens 通过 cross-attention \n      attend to vision patches）在 LIBERO Object 上 fine-tune 后进行 pruning sweep。\n      验证第 4 种 connector family 的 pruning behavior。此前训练尝试因基础设施问题被 kill。\n    expected_results:\n      baseline_object_sr: 58.0\n      baseline_ci95: [53.5, 62.4]\n      # Pruning curve (L2norm)\n      l2norm_k095_sr: 52.0\n      l2norm_k09_sr: 42.0\n      l2norm_k07_sr: 22.0\n      l2norm_k05_sr: 10.0\n      # Pruning curve (random)\n      random_k095_sr: 50.0\n      random_k09_sr: 38.0\n      random_k07_sr: 18.0\n      random_k05_sr: 8.0\n      # Diagnostic\n      importance_cv: 0.22\n      entropy_ratio: 0.82\n      # Classification\n      connector_class: \"token-entangling (cross-attention)\"\n      pruning_pattern: \"steep graded → threshold at k≈0.7\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Perceiver Resampler 的 cross-attention 机制创造了中等程度的 token entanglement：\n      \n      1. **Entanglement 机制**：64 query tokens 各自通过 cross-attention attend 全部 vision \n         patches。每个 output token 不再对应特定 spatial region（unlike linear proj），\n         而是 learned mixture of all patches。但与 pixel-shuffle 不同，这种 mixture \n         是 learned 的且 query-specific，因此不同 query 可能 specialize to different \n         spatial/semantic aspects。\n      \n      2. **CV 预测 ~0.22**：介于 X-VLA（0.151）和 SmolVLA（0.314）之间。\n         Cross-attention 创造的依赖比 BART sequential mixing 更直接但不如 pixel-shuffle \n         的空间折叠极端。Query specialization 产生 moderate importance heterogeneity。\n      \n      3. **Pruning pattern 预测**：steep graded degradation。k=0.95 开始可见 drop \n         （~10% relative），k=0.7 显著下降（~60% relative），k=0.5 接近 collapse。\n         比 OpenVLA/MLP 更陡但不如 SmolVLA/pixel-shuffle catastrophic。\n      \n      4. **Baseline 预测 ~58%**：first-attempt fine-tuning on LIBERO，\n         RoboFlamingo original architecture 不是为 LIBERO 任务优化的。\n         合理的 mid-range SR。\n      \n      5. **L2norm ≈ random**：CV ~0.22 处于 L2norm 和 random 的交叉区域，\n         两种方法差异应 <5pp，类似 OpenVLA pattern。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: Perceiver Resampler pruning curve (predicted)\"\n        columns: [\"k\", \"Tokens kept\", \"L2norm SR(%)\", \"Random SR(%)\", \"Δ(R-L2)\"]\n        data:\n          - [\"1.0\", \"64\", \"58.0\", \"58.0\", \"0\"]\n          - [\"0.95\", \"61\", \"52.0\", \"50.0\", \"-2.0\"]\n          - [\"0.9\", \"58\", \"42.0\", \"38.0\", \"-4.0\"]\n          - [\"0.7\", \"45\", \"22.0\", \"18.0\", \"-4.0\"]\n          - [\"0.5\", \"32\", \"10.0\", \"8.0\", \"-2.0\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 4-connector family pruning curves on same axes — Linear (π0.5, flat), MLP (OpenVLA, gradual), Perceiver (RoboFlamingo, steep graded), Pixel-shuffle (SmolVLA, cliff). Continuous spectrum of pruning tolerance.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Perceiver Resampler 填补了 connector spectrum 的空白——在 MLP（graded）和 pixel-shuffle \n      （catastrophic）之间提供了第 4 个 data point。如果 CV ~0.22 且 pruning pattern \n      呈 steep graded，它将进一步验证 CV 作为 continuous predictor 的有效性。\n      \n      对 paper 的贡献：从 3 connector families 扩展到 4，增加了 paper 的 generalizability。\n      但即使此实验因基础设施问题未完成，paper 已有 5 models × 3 families 的充分覆盖，\n      Perceiver 可作为 future work 提及。在 best tier 下，此实验成功完成并增加 paper \n      的 reviewer 说服力。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 11. E5 attention-based pruning (implicit, not in plan YAML)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"E5 attention-based pruning — correct importance metric for entangling connectors\"\n    plan_id: \"e5_attention_pruning_xvla\"\n    description: >\n      X-VLA attention-based token pruning（last-layer / mean / rollout）在 4 suites 上验证。\n      核心发现：attention-based importance 在 entangling connector 上远优于 L2norm，\n      因为 attention 捕获了 BART encoder 创造的 cross-token dependencies。\n      已有数据覆盖 Object/Spatial/Goal/Long at k=0.5 和 k=0.3/k=0.7 部分点。\n      Goal suite 泛化已确认（SR=96.8-98.2% at k=0.5）。\n    expected_results:\n      # Object suite (confirmed)\n      attn_last_obj_k05: 99.2\n      attn_mean_obj_k05: 98.4\n      attn_rollout_obj_k05: 97.4\n      attn_last_obj_k07: 99.2\n      attn_last_obj_k03: 84.2\n      attn_mean_obj_k03: 96.0\n      attn_rollout_obj_k03: 92.0\n      # Spatial suite (confirmed)\n      attn_last_spatial_k05: 88.8\n      attn_mean_spatial_k05: 91.6\n      attn_rollout_spatial_k05: 92.8\n      attn_last_spatial_k03: 85.6\n      attn_mean_spatial_k03: 90.4\n      # Goal suite (confirmed — key best-tier assumption)\n      attn_last_goal_k05: 98.2\n      attn_mean_goal_k05: 97.4\n      attn_rollout_goal_k05: 96.8\n      # Long suite (confirmed)\n      attn_last_long_k05: 90.2\n      attn_mean_long_k05: 94.0\n      attn_rollout_long_k05: 94.8\n      attn_last_long_k05_seed43: 90.4\n      attn_mean_long_k05_seed43: 94.6\n      # vs L2norm comparison at k=0.5\n      l2norm_obj_k05: 42.6\n      attn_advantage_obj_k05_pp: 56.6\n      l2norm_goal_k05: 59.0\n      attn_advantage_goal_k05_pp: 39.2\n      l2norm_long_k05: 44.6\n      attn_advantage_long_k05_pp: 45.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      E5 attention pruning 成功的根本原因：attention weights 直接编码了 BART encoder \n      创造的 cross-token dependencies。L2norm 失败（特别是在 aggressive compression 下）\n      是因为 BART 使 token norms 近乎 uniform（CV=0.151），导致 L2norm selection \n      退化为 spatial clustering。而 attention weights 捕获了 decoder 实际需要哪些 token，\n      考虑了 cross-token 依赖关系。\n      \n      Cross-suite 一致性的原因：\n      - Object k=0.5 = 99.2%：简单任务 + attention guidance = near-perfect（仅需保留 \n        与 language instruction 相关的 object tokens）\n      - Goal k=0.5 = 98.2%：complex task 但 attention 正确识别了 multi-step 所需的 \n        critical tokens，消除了 task complexity amplification\n      - Long k=0.5 = 90.2%：最长 horizon，attention 仍能恢复大部分（vs L2norm 44.6%），\n        但 10pp gap vs baseline 来自 long-horizon compounding 的不可完全消除的 information loss\n      - Spatial k=0.5 = 88.8-92.8%：spatial tasks 需要 precise spatial token coverage，\n        attention 基本正确但不完美\n      \n      \"Correct importance metric rescues entangling connectors\" story：\n      X-VLA L2norm k=0.5 = 42.6% vs attention k=0.5 = 99.2% → +56.6pp。\n      这证明 pruning failure on entangling connectors 不是因为 information 不可保留，\n      而是因为 wrong importance metric。Attention-based pruning 是 correct metric。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: E5 attention pruning vs L2norm on X-VLA (k=0.5, all suites)\"\n        columns: [\"Suite\", \"Baseline\", \"L2norm SR(%)\", \"Random SR(%)\", \"Attn-last SR(%)\", \"Attn-mean SR(%)\", \"Attn advantage vs L2 (pp)\"]\n        data:\n          - [\"Object\", \"99.2\", \"42.6\", \"70.6\", \"99.2\", \"98.4\", \"+56.6\"]\n          - [\"Spatial\", \"93.0\", \"58.8\", \"71.4\", \"88.8\", \"91.6\", \"+30.0\"]\n          - [\"Goal\", \"98.4\", \"59.0\", \"67.2\", \"98.2\", \"97.4\", \"+39.2\"]\n          - [\"Long\", \"94.0\", \"44.6\", \"61.6\", \"90.2\", \"94.0\", \"+45.6\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: X-VLA pruning method comparison across 4 suites at k=0.5. Three bars per suite (L2norm, random, attention). Attention near-baseline everywhere, L2norm catastrophic on Object/Long.\"\n      - \"Fig: Attention advantage heatmap — rows=suites, columns=k values. Color intensity shows pp advantage of attention over L2norm. Hottest zones at aggressive k × complex tasks.\"\n    analysis: >\n      E5 是 best tier 的关键 complementary contribution。它证明：\n      1. Entangling connectors 的 pruning failure 是 metric failure，不是 fundamental limit\n      2. 正确的 importance metric（attention）can rescue X-VLA 至 near-baseline（99.2% at k=0.5）\n      3. Goal suite 泛化完美（98.2%），确认 assumption 5\n      4. 为 Diagnose-then-Compress framework 增加第三步：Diagnose（CV）→ Choose method \n         （attention for low-CV entangling, L2norm for high-CV independent）→ Compress（VTR if needed）\n      \n      Paper positioning：§4.7 或 supplementary，作为实用价值的补充。\n      不改变 primary contribution（2-axis framework + CV diagnostic），\n      但显著增强 method contribution 的完整性。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 12. CV-strategy scaling law final validation\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Scaling law cross-validation (k=0.5 and k=0.7, 3 models)\"\n    plan_id: \"c6_libero_suite_expansion\"\n    description: >\n      CV-strategy scaling law（Δ(R-L2) monotonically decreasing with CV）在 k=0.5 和 k=0.7 \n      已确认，无例外。Final validation 确保 remaining seeds 不引入 exceptions。\n    expected_results:\n      # k=0.5 scaling law (confirmed, no new exceptions)\n      pi05_delta_R_L2_k05: 36.0\n      xvla_delta_R_L2_k05: 26.9\n      openvla_delta_R_L2_k05: -1.8\n      spearman_k05: -1.0\n      # k=0.7 scaling law (confirmed)\n      pi05_delta_R_L2_k07: 22.2\n      xvla_delta_R_L2_k07: 6.5\n      openvla_delta_R_L2_k07: -5.4\n      spearman_k07: -1.0\n      # Absolute Spearman\n      cv_strategy_abs_spearman: 1.0\n      scaling_law_holds_both_k: true\n      new_exceptions: 0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Scaling law 在 k=0.5 和 k=0.7 均展示完美的 monotonic pattern（|ρ|=1.0）：\n      CV 越低（tokens 越 uniform），L2norm 越 harmful（因为 uniform distribution 上的 \n      norm-based selection 退化为 spatial clustering），random 越有优势。\n      \n      机制链：\n      CV=0.055（π0.5）→ near-uniform importance → L2norm clusters spatially → \n      catastrophic coverage loss → +36pp random advantage\n      \n      CV=0.151（X-VLA）→ moderate uniformity → L2norm partial clustering → \n      +27pp random advantage（smaller because BART creates some meaningful differentiation）\n      \n      CV=0.215（OpenVLA）→ meaningful differentiation → L2norm preserves important tokens → \n      -1.8pp（L2norm slightly better, importance-based selection effective）\n      \n      k=0.7 gap 小于 k=0.5 gap（22.2 vs 36.0 for π0.5）因为 k=0.7 保留更多 tokens，\n      spatial coverage loss 更轻。但 monotonic ordering 保持不变。\n      \n      Remaining seeds（已通过 multi-seed 确认）不会引入 exceptions：\n      - π0.5 L2norm k=0.5 dual-seed: 33.4/33.6（std=0.1pp）\n      - X-VLA random k=0.5 tri-seed: 70.6/71.0/69.2（σ=0.9pp）\n      - Gap reproducibility confirmed across all available seeds。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: CV-Strategy Scaling Law (dual k validation)\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"CV\", \"Δ(R-L2) k=0.5 (pp)\", \"Δ(R-L2) k=0.7 (pp)\", \"Direction\"]\n        data:\n          - [\"pi0.5\", \"0.055\", \"+36.0\", \"+22.2\", \"Random >> L2norm\"]\n          - [\"X-VLA\", \"0.151\", \"+26.9\", \"+6.5\", \"Random > L2norm\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"0.215\", \"-1.8\", \"-5.4\", \"L2norm >= Random\"]\n          - [\"SmolVLA\", \"0.314\", \"N/A (both 0%)\", \"N/A\", \"Method-independent\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Scaling law scatter plot — x=CV, y=Δ(R-L2). Two series (k=0.5 solid, k=0.7 dashed). Both monotonically decreasing. Crossover from random-advantage to L2norm-advantage at CV≈0.2.\"\n    analysis: >\n      |Spearman|=1.0 at both k values 落在 best tier 范围 [0.85, 1.0] 内（实际是上界）。\n      Scaling law 是 Claim 5 的核心，提供了 practitioner-facing 的 prescriptive guidance：\n      measure CV → if CV<0.15: use random pruning; if CV>0.2: use L2norm; \n      if 0.15<CV<0.2: either method works at mild compression。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":149,"cache_read_input_tokens":145436,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":149},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"71bd17d0-2db3-4573-a2d4-98d47eafc079","uuid":"b496ac9e-3fca-4a96-9c8b-f9eb62a647bd"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":656022,"duration_api_ms":659071,"num_turns":8,"result":"Lock file is empty. I have all the information needed from the experiment plan and registry. Let me now generate the comprehensive predictions.\n\n```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  2-axis framework（connector coupling × task complexity）在所有 model×suite 组合中得到干净验证。\n  CV diagnostic 形成完整的连续预测谱（0.038→0.314），scaling law 在 k=0.5 和 k=0.7 均成立且无例外。\n  π0.5 uniformly critical 行为（L2norm 高原 + random cliff）泛化至 Spatial/Goal/Long，机制一致。\n  VTR connector-dependency（pixel-shuffle 有效、MLP 失败）是干净且可解释的结果。\n  E5 attention pruning 在 Goal suite 上完美泛化（SR=96.8-98.2%），为 entangling connector 提供\n  \"correct importance metric rescues\" 叙事。5 claims 全部保留，reviewer concern RC7 被 4 suites 完全化解。\n  Paper title 不变。叙事核心：Analysis（primary）+ Diagnose-then-Compress method（secondary）。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 1. c4_learned_reencoding_smolvla (in_progress → effectively complete)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"VTR M-sweep tri-seed completion (SmolVLA)\"\n    plan_id: \"c4_learned_reencoding_smolvla\"\n    description: >\n      SmolVLA VTR cross-attention M=16/32/64/96/128 全部 3-seed 完成。\n      MLP adapter M=32 3-seed 完成。M-curve 平坦性、架构独立性、near-lossless compression 已确认。\n      剩余工作：最终统计汇总与 paper table 生成。\n    expected_results:\n      m16_3seed_mean_sr: 56.9\n      m16_3seed_std: 1.3\n      m32_3seed_mean_sr: 60.1\n      m32_3seed_std: 1.3\n      m64_3seed_mean_sr: 62.0\n      m64_3seed_std: 2.3\n      m96_3seed_mean_sr: 54.5\n      m96_3seed_std: 3.2\n      m128_3seed_mean_sr: 58.0\n      m128_3seed_std: 3.5\n      mlp_adapter_m32_mean_sr: 63.4\n      mlp_adapter_m32_std: 2.6\n      vtr_recovery_ratio_m128: 0.98\n      m_curve_max_range_pp: 7.5\n      vtc_vs_mlp_pvalue: 0.15\n      baseline_sr: 59.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      M-curve 平坦的根本原因：pixel-shuffle 的空间折叠创造了可逆的 token 纠缠。VTR 的 cross-attention\n      学习了\"展开\"这种纠缠的映射——无论压缩到多少 query token（M=16→128），只要保留足够的 capacity\n      来表示空间结构，re-encoding 就能恢复。M=128 passthrough（58.0%）≈baseline（59.2%）证明\n      VTR 是恢复而非增强。MLP adapter 与 cross-attention 无显著差异（p=0.15）证明任何 learned \n      re-encoding 都能完成此恢复，不依赖特定架构机制。M=96 dip（p=0.034 vs M=64）是统计真实但\n      实际影响有限的波动（54.5% 仍远高于 0% hard pruning）。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: SmolVLA VTR M-sweep (3-seed)\"\n        columns: [\"M\", \"Compression\", \"SR mean±std (%)\", \"vs Baseline Δ (pp)\", \"p vs M=128\"]\n        data:\n          - [\"16\", \"87.5%\", \"56.9±1.3\", \"-2.3\", \">0.25\"]\n          - [\"32\", \"75%\", \"60.1±1.3\", \"+0.9\", \">0.25\"]\n          - [\"64\", \"50%\", \"62.0±2.3\", \"+2.8\", \">0.25\"]\n          - [\"96\", \"25%\", \"54.5±3.2\", \"-4.7\", \"0.034*\"]\n          - [\"128\", \"0% (passthrough)\", \"58.0±3.5\", \"-1.2\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"MLP-adapter@32\", \"75%\", \"63.4±2.6\", \"+4.2\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Hard pruning k=0.5\", \"50%\", \"0.0\", \"-59.2\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: M-curve flat plot — x=M (16→128), y=SR(%). Horizontal band at baseline 59.2%±5pp, all M values within band. Hard pruning 0% shown as contrast.\"\n    analysis: >\n      VTR 在 pixel-shuffle connector 上实现 near-lossless compression at ANY ratio（0-87.5%）。\n      这是 Claim 4 的核心证据。M=16 87.5% compression 仅损失 2.3pp，而 hard pruning 在 5% removal \n      即 collapse 至 0%。recovery ratio 0.98 落在 best tier 目标范围 [0.95, 1.05] 内。\n      架构独立性（VTC vs MLP p=0.15）排除了特定机制假说，支持\"任何 learned re-encoding 均可修复\n      pixel-shuffle entanglement\"的一般性结论。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 2. c4_ext_method_universality_openvla (in_progress)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"VTR on OpenVLA (MLP projector) — connector-dependent ceiling\"\n    plan_id: \"c4_ext_method_universality_openvla\"\n    description: >\n      VTR M=128 full training 已确认 0% SR（overfitting, 每步输出相同 action）。\n      VTC-only M=32/M=64 作为 fallback 继续训练。预测结果为 clean negative：\n      VTR 对 MLP projector 无效，VTR ceiling 取决于 connector 类型。\n    expected_results:\n      vtconly_m32_sr: 0.0\n      vtconly_m64_sr: 0.0\n      vtconly_m96_sr: 0.0\n      vtr_m128_sr: 0.0\n      openvla_baseline_sr: 74.0\n      failure_mode: \"overfitting — model outputs identical action per step\"\n      connector_dependency_confirmed: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      MLP projector tokens 已经是独立且有意义的（CV=0.215，信息分布在 token 间有分化）。\n      VTR 的 cross-attention 试图将这些已经 well-structured 的 token 重新编码为更少的 query \n      token，但这个重新编码过程引入了不必要的复杂性。MLP token 的信息是 per-token 局部化的，\n      与 pixel-shuffle token 的空间纠缠不同——后者的信息恢复 requires 全局 re-arrangement，\n      恰好是 VTR cross-attention 擅长的。对 MLP projector，简单的 hard pruning（k=0.5 仍有 \n      37.4% SR）比 VTR 更有效，因为保留的 token 仍然 individually meaningful。VTR 的 22M \n      额外参数在缺乏 spatial entanglement repair 目标时退化为纯噪声拟合器。\n      所有 M 值（32/64/96/128）均失败进一步证明这不是超参数问题而是架构兼容性问题。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: VTR connector-dependency summary\"\n        columns: [\"Connector\", \"Model\", \"CV\", \"Hard prune k=0.5 SR(%)\", \"VTR M=32 SR(%)\", \"VTR Δ vs prune (pp)\"]\n        data:\n          - [\"Pixel-shuffle\", \"SmolVLA\", \"0.314\", \"0.0\", \"60.1\", \"+60.1\"]\n          - [\"MLP (3-layer)\", \"OpenVLA\", \"0.215\", \"37.4\", \"0.0\", \"-37.4\"]\n          - [\"Linear+BART\", \"X-VLA\", \"0.151\", \"42.6(L2)/70.6(R)\", \"N/A\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: VTR recovery diagram — SmolVLA: 0%→60% (recovery), OpenVLA: 37%→0% (degradation). Visual contrast showing connector-dependent VTR ceiling.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Clean negative result 强化了 paper narrative：VTR 是 pixel-shuffle 的特解而非通用压缩方法。\n      这从 weakness 变为 strength——说明 Diagnose-then-Compress framework 的第一步（CV diagnostic）\n      是必要的，因为不同 connector 需要不同的 compression strategy。MLP projector 应用 simple \n      pruning（已有 graded degradation），pixel-shuffle 应用 VTR re-encoding。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 3. c4_ext_openvla_msweep (in_progress)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"OpenVLA VTC M-sweep training (M=32/64/96)\"\n    plan_id: \"c4_ext_openvla_msweep\"\n    description: >\n      OpenVLA VTC-only（无 backbone fine-tuning）M-sweep 训练。此前 M=96_v3 和 M=64_v3 \n      均报 failed/negative。预测所有 M 值均无法恢复 SR，与 c4_ext 一致。\n    expected_results:\n      m32_vtconly_sr: 0.0\n      m64_vtconly_sr: 0.0\n      m96_vtconly_sr: 0.0\n      training_loss_converges: true\n      eval_sr_zero: true\n      diagnosis: \"VTC learns to minimize training loss but does not transfer to closed-loop control\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      VTC-only 模式冻结了 backbone，仅训练 22M compressor 参数。对 MLP projector，\n      backbone 已经学习了 per-token semantically meaningful representations。VTC \n      强制将 256 个有独立语义的 token 映射到更少的 query token，丢失了 token-level \n      semantic granularity。训练 loss 收敛（因为 cross-attention 可以学习压缩映射）\n      但 closed-loop control 失败，因为 action prediction 依赖 fine-grained token \n      discrimination 而非 compressed summary。与 SmolVLA 不同，SmolVLA 的 pixel-shuffle \n      token 本身缺乏 individual semantics（每个 token 编码 32×32 pixel region），\n      VTR re-encoding 只需恢复 spatial structure 而非 semantic content。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      所有 M 值失败构成 c4_ext 的完整 ablation：VTR 的有效性严格绑定到 pixel-shuffle \n      connector 的空间纠缠修复功能。Paper 中作为 §5.3 \"Re-encoding mechanism\" 的\n      反面证据，说明 VTR 不是通用 token compressor。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 4. c1_xvla_threshold_localization (in_progress → effectively complete)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"X-VLA cliff threshold 3-seed localization\"\n    plan_id: \"c1_xvla_threshold_localization\"\n    description: >\n      X-VLA k=0.8 和 k=0.85 的 3-seed 精确定位已完成。\n      k=0.80=89.0±0.72pp, k=0.85=67.9±0.31pp。Non-monotonic recovery 确认。\n    expected_results:\n      k080_3seed_mean: 89.0\n      k080_3seed_std: 0.72\n      k085_3seed_mean: 67.9\n      k085_3seed_std: 0.31\n      nonmonotonic_gap_pp: 21.1\n      cliff_zone: \"k=0.82-0.87\"\n      deterministic_sd_below_1pp: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      BART encoder（12 层 transformer）在 42 tokens（k=0.85）时触发 length-dependent \n      interaction breakdown。42 tokens 是 BART 自注意力模式的临界密度——低于此密度，\n      BART 的 cross-token mixing 产生的依赖链被截断，导致 cascading information loss。\n      40 tokens（k=0.8）反而恢复，因为 token 密度进一步降低使 BART 退化为 \n      near-independent processing（类似纯 linear projection 行为）。SD<1pp 证明这是 \n      完全 deterministic 的架构属性，非随机效应。3-seed 一致性消除了训练 seed 混淆因素。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: X-VLA cliff localization (L2norm, 3-seed)\"\n        columns: [\"k\", \"Tokens kept\", \"Seed 42\", \"Seed 43\", \"Seed 44\", \"Mean±SD\"]\n        data:\n          - [\"0.90\", \"45\", \"97.6\", \"98.2\", \"99.4\", \"98.4±0.9\"]\n          - [\"0.85\", \"42\", \"68.0\", \"67.6\", \"68.2\", \"67.9±0.3\"]\n          - [\"0.80\", \"40\", \"88.8\", \"88.4\", \"89.8\", \"89.0±0.7\"]\n          - [\"0.70\", \"35\", \"56.2\", \"58.2\", \"56.4\", \"56.9±1.1\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: X-VLA pruning curve with cliff zone highlighted. k=0.85 dip (67.9%) below k=0.8 (89.0%) creating non-monotonic pattern. Error bars from 3-seed.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cliff 定位精确到 k=0.82-0.87 区间。Non-monotonicity 是 BART encoder 的 emergent \n      property：存在一个 critical token density 使得 BART self-attention 的 cross-token \n      mixing 恰好最大化 information cascading damage。Paper figure 将此作为 \n      token-entangling connector 的典型特征展示。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 5. diagnostic_oft_cv (in_progress → effectively complete)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"OFT token importance CV measurement\"\n    plan_id: \"diagnostic_oft_cv\"\n    description: >\n      OpenVLA-OFT CV 已从 openvla_entropy_real 和 analysis 中确认为 0.219。\n      Entropy=0.667≈Standard(0.661)。完成 5/5 model diagnostic table。\n    expected_results:\n      oft_cv: 0.219\n      oft_entropy: 0.667\n      standard_openvla_cv: 0.215\n      cv_delta_oft_vs_standard: 0.004\n      entropy_delta: 0.006\n      connector_determines_attention: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      OFT 与 Standard OpenVLA 共享相同的 3-layer MLP connector（DINOv2+SigLIP fusion \n      仅增加输入通道但不改变 MLP mixing 结构）。Action head 差异（OFT diffusion vs \n      Standard autoregressive）不影响 vision token attention 分布，因为 attention \n      pattern 由 connector 在 vision-LLM 接口处决定，action head 在 LLM output 端操作。\n      CV 0.219≈0.215 差异在 noise level（<0.01），证明 connector 是 attention structure \n      的唯一决定因素。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: Complete 6-model diagnostic spectrum\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Connector\", \"Params\", \"Tokens\", \"Entropy\", \"CV\", \"Pruning Class\"]\n        data:\n          - [\"pi0\", \"Pure linear\", \"3.3B\", \"256\", \"0.959\", \"0.038\", \"Immune\"]\n          - [\"pi0.5\", \"Pure linear (x sqrt_d)\", \"4B\", \"768\", \"~0.67\", \"0.055\", \"Uniformly Critical\"]\n          - [\"X-VLA\", \"Linear+BART 12L\", \"880M\", \"50\", \"0.614\", \"0.151\", \"Threshold-graded\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"3-layer MLP\", \"7B\", \"256\", \"0.661\", \"0.215\", \"Smooth graded\"]\n          - [\"OFT\", \"3-layer MLP (DINOv2+SigLIP)\", \"7B\", \"512\", \"0.667\", \"0.219\", \"Smooth graded (expected)\"]\n          - [\"SmolVLA\", \"Pixel-shuffle 16x\", \"450M\", \"128\", \"0.952\", \"0.314\", \"Catastrophic\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      6-model diagnostic table 完整化。CV 连续谱 0.038→0.314 无间断地预测 pruning tolerance。\n      OFT entry 作为 action head 对照实验消除了\"action head 影响 pruning\"的替代假说。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 6. c6_libero_suite_expansion (in_progress)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Cross-suite 2-axis framework validation (5 models × 4 suites)\"\n    plan_id: \"c6_libero_suite_expansion\"\n    description: >\n      5 models × 4 LIBERO suites × 2 methods（L2norm/random）全矩阵填充。\n      已收集绝大部分数据。剩余：OpenVLA Spatial random k=0.9, OpenVLA Long L2norm/random k=0.9,\n      部分 OpenVLA attention cross-suite。预测所有剩余数据点与 2-axis framework 一致。\n    expected_results:\n      # Axis-2 amplification (entangling connectors)\n      xvla_object_k09_sr: 97.6\n      xvla_goal_k09_sr: 70.2\n      xvla_long_k09_sr: 27.5\n      xvla_amplification_object_to_goal_pp: 27.4\n      xvla_amplification_object_to_long_pp: 70.1\n      # Axis-2 amplification (independent connectors)\n      pi05_l2norm_object_k09_sr: 98.2\n      pi05_l2norm_goal_k09_sr: 90.6\n      pi05_l2norm_long_k09_sr: 81.0\n      pi05_amplification_object_to_goal_pp: 7.6\n      pi05_amplification_object_to_long_pp: 17.2\n      # OpenVLA remaining predictions\n      openvla_spatial_random_k09_sr: 67.0\n      openvla_long_l2norm_k09_sr: 46.0\n      openvla_long_random_k09_sr: 43.0\n      # SmolVLA cross-suite (all zero)\n      smolvla_spatial_k095_sr: 0.0\n      smolvla_goal_k095_sr: 0.0\n      smolvla_long_k095_sr: 0.0\n      # Framework accuracy\n      cross_suite_framework_accuracy_pct: 95\n      axis2_amplification_entangling_min_pp: 27.4\n      axis2_amplification_independent_max_pp: 17.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      Axis-2（task complexity）放大效应的机制：complex tasks（Goal/Long）要求 multi-step \n      reasoning，每一步的 action prediction 依赖前一步保留的 spatial information。\n      Token-entangling connectors（BART/pixel-shuffle）的 pruning damage 在 multi-step \n      中 compound——单步小损失在序列中累积为大损失。Token-independent connectors（linear/MLP）\n      的 pruning damage 是 per-step 局部的，不会 cascade。\n      \n      具体预测依据：\n      - X-VLA Object→Goal 27.4pp 已确认（same k=0.9, same method, only task differs）\n      - X-VLA Object→Long 更大（70.1pp）因为 Long 任务平均 horizon 更长，compounding 更严重\n      - π0.5 L2norm Object→Goal 仅 7.6pp（low CV 使得 L2norm 选择的 token 在 spatial \n        coverage 上已近最优，task complexity 无法放大 spatial coverage 的已有优势）\n      - π0.5 Object→Long 17.2pp 稍大，但仍 <20pp（independent connector 上限）\n      \n      OpenVLA 剩余预测：\n      - Spatial random k=0.9≈67%：OpenVLA Spatial baseline=80%, L2norm k=0.9=75%。\n        Random 通常比 L2norm 低 5-8pp（CV=0.215 使 L2norm 有轻微优势）\n      - Long L2norm k=0.9≈46%：Long baseline=52.8%, 相对保留率≈OpenVLA Object pattern\n      - Long random k=0.9≈43%：随机稍差于 L2norm（high CV）\n      \n      SmolVLA 全 suite 0%：pixel-shuffle 纠缠在任何 task distribution 下都导致 catastrophic \n      failure。Spatial/Goal 的 baseline 较低（44.6%/60.8%）不影响 cliff-edge——即使 baseline \n      更低，k=0.95 pruning 仍然 collapse 至 0%。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: 2-Axis Framework — Axis-2 amplification at k=0.9 (L2norm)\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"CV\", \"Connector\", \"Object SR(%)\", \"Spatial SR(%)\", \"Goal SR(%)\", \"Long SR(%)\", \"Amplif O→G (pp)\"]\n        data:\n          - [\"pi0.5\", \"0.055\", \"Linear\", \"98.2\", \"95.0\", \"90.6\", \"81.0\", \"7.6\"]\n          - [\"X-VLA\", \"0.151\", \"Lin+BART\", \"97.6\", \"78.8\", \"70.2\", \"27.5\", \"27.4\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"0.215\", \"MLP\", \"70.6\", \"75.0\", \"74.8\", \"46.0\", \"-4.2*\"]\n          - [\"SmolVLA\", \"0.314\", \"Pix-shuf\", \"0.0\", \"0.0\", \"0.0\", \"0.0\", \"N/A\"]\n      - title: \"Table: Cross-suite pruning sensitivity heatmap (SR at k=0.5, random)\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Object\", \"Spatial\", \"Goal\", \"Long\"]\n        data:\n          - [\"pi0.5\", \"69.4 (68.9†)\", \"71.6\", \"73.6\", \"46.8\"]\n          - [\"X-VLA\", \"70.6 (70.3†)\", \"71.4\", \"67.9†\", \"61.6\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"35.8\", \"~36\", \"52.2\", \"~35\"]\n          - [\"SmolVLA\", \"0.0\", \"0.6\", \"0.0\", \"0.0\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 2-axis heatmap — rows=models (sorted by CV), columns=suites (sorted by complexity). Color=SR at k=0.9. Clear gradient: entangling connectors show steep color change across suites, independent connectors show mild change.\"\n      - \"Fig: Amplification bar chart — grouped bars per model showing Object→Goal SR drop (pp). X-VLA 27.4pp tower vs π0.5 7.6pp bar. Horizontal line at 20pp separating entangling/independent zones.\"\n    analysis: >\n      2-axis framework 在 95% 的 model×suite cells 中正确预测 pruning outcome。\n      唯一的 partial exception：OpenVLA Goal k=0.9 SR（74.8%）高于 Object k=0.9（70.6%），\n      但这是 baseline difference（Goal baseline 74.8% = Object baseline 74%），相对 \n      degradation 是一致的。Framework accuracy 95% 落在 best tier 范围 [90, 100] 内。\n      \n      Key axis-2 interaction：entangling connectors 放大倍数 27.4pp（X-VLA Object→Goal）\n      落在 best tier 范围 [25, 45] 内。Independent connectors 保持 ≤10pp（π0.5 7.6pp）\n      符合假设。Long suite 的更大放大（X-VLA 70.1pp, π0.5 17.2pp）与 horizon length \n      正相关，进一步验证 compounding damage 机制。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 7. c6_libero_suite_vtr (planned)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"VTR cross-suite generalization (SmolVLA Long)\"\n    plan_id: \"c6_libero_suite_vtr\"\n    description: >\n      SmolVLA VTR M=32 已在 Spatial（53.2%）和 Goal（56.4%）验证。\n      剩余：Long suite（baseline 36.6%）的 VTR recovery。\n      预测 M=32 Long≈33-38%，完成 Diagnose-then-Compress 全 suite 验证。\n    expected_results:\n      smolvla_long_baseline_sr: 36.6\n      smolvla_long_hard_prune_k05_sr: 0.0\n      smolvla_long_hard_prune_k095_sr: 0.0\n      vtr_m32_long_sr: 35.5\n      vtr_m32_long_ci95_lower: 31.0\n      vtr_m32_long_ci95_upper: 40.0\n      vtr_m32_spatial_sr: 53.2\n      vtr_m32_goal_sr: 56.4\n      vtr_m32_object_sr: 60.1\n      recovery_ratio_long: 0.97\n      cross_suite_recovery_consistent: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      VTR cross-suite recovery ratio 预测≈0.97（35.5/36.6）：\n      \n      1. M-curve 平坦性在 Object suite 已确认——VTR 的 re-encoding 修复 spatial \n         entanglement，这是 connector-level 属性，与 task distribution 无关。\n      2. Spatial recovery 53.2%/43.8%=1.21 和 Goal recovery 56.4%/60.8%=0.93 \n         显示 cross-suite recovery ratio 围绕 1.0 波动（±20%），中位数 ≈1.0。\n      3. Long suite baseline 较低（36.6% vs Object 59.2%）因为 Long 任务本身更难，\n         但 VTR 不应额外降低——它只修复 pruning damage，不影响 task difficulty。\n      4. Long 的稍低 recovery（预测 0.97）可能源于 Long horizon 放大了 VTR \n         re-encoding 中的微小信息损失，但效果应 <5pp。\n      \n      VTR 在 Long 上仍将远超 hard pruning（35.5% vs 0%），完成全 4 suites 的 \n      \"recovery from cliff-edge\" 证据链。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: VTR M=32 cross-suite recovery\"\n        columns: [\"Suite\", \"Baseline SR(%)\", \"Hard prune k=0.5 SR(%)\", \"VTR M=32 SR(%)\", \"Recovery ratio\"]\n        data:\n          - [\"Object\", \"59.2\", \"0.0\", \"60.1\", \"1.015\"]\n          - [\"Spatial\", \"43.8*\", \"0.6\", \"53.2\", \"1.21*\"]\n          - [\"Goal\", \"60.8*\", \"0.0\", \"56.4\", \"0.93\"]\n          - [\"Long\", \"36.6\", \"0.0\", \"35.5 (pred)\", \"0.97 (pred)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: VTR recovery bar chart — 4 suites side by side, each showing baseline (gray), hard prune (red, near 0), VTR M=32 (green, near baseline). Consistent recovery pattern across all suites.\"\n    analysis: >\n      VTR cross-suite generalization证明 re-encoding 修复的是 architectural entanglement \n      而非 task-specific information。Recovery ratio ≈1.0 across 4 suites 支持 Claim 4：\n      \"Learned Re-Encoding Achieves Near-Lossless Compression Where Deletion Fails\"。\n      vtr_smolvla_recovery_ratio 0.97 落在 best tier 范围 [0.95, 1.05] 内。\n      \n      对 practitioner 的 implication：使用 pixel-shuffle connector 的 VLA 可以通过 \n      VTR 实现任意压缩比而无显著 SR 损失。22M 额外参数 + 6% latency overhead 是可接受的代价。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 8. c1_pi05_immune_confirmation (planned → effectively complete via registry)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"π0.5 uniformly critical behavior cross-suite validation\"\n    plan_id: \"c1_pi05_immune_confirmation\"\n    description: >\n      π0.5（4B, PaliGemma linear proj）已完成 4 suites baseline + 全面 pruning sweep。\n      CV=0.055 confirmed。L2norm plateau（k≥0.85 maintains ≥98% Object, ≥88% Spatial/Goal）\n      和 random cliff（k=0.85-0.925 Object collapse）均已 multi-seed 验证。\n      Scaling law extreme（Δ(R-L2)=+36pp at k=0.5）confirmed。\n      剩余工作：Cross-suite 一致性最终确认 + paper narrative 整合。\n    expected_results:\n      # Baselines (confirmed)\n      baseline_object: 98.2\n      baseline_spatial: 97.2\n      baseline_goal: 96.4\n      baseline_long: 92.8\n      cv: 0.055\n      # L2norm plateau (confirmed)\n      l2norm_k095_object: 98.2\n      l2norm_k09_object: 98.2\n      l2norm_k085_object: 98.0\n      l2norm_k095_spatial: 97.8\n      l2norm_k09_spatial: 95.0\n      l2norm_k085_spatial: 88.6\n      l2norm_k095_goal: 90.8\n      l2norm_k09_goal: 90.6\n      l2norm_k085_goal: 88.0\n      l2norm_k095_long: 87.0\n      l2norm_k09_long: 81.0\n      l2norm_k085_long: 78.4\n      # Random cliff (confirmed)\n      random_k095_object: 74.0\n      random_k0925_object: 27.6\n      random_k09_object: 9.0\n      random_k085_object: 5.0\n      random_k095_spatial: 76.4\n      random_k0925_spatial: 58.2\n      random_k09_spatial: 54.6\n      random_k085_spatial: 60.2\n      random_k095_goal: 83.8\n      random_k0925_goal: 70.0\n      random_k09_goal: 62.2\n      random_k085_goal: 52.4\n      random_k095_long: 63.2\n      random_k09_long: 31.8\n      random_k085_long: 45.2\n      # Scaling law contribution\n      l2norm_k05_object: 33.4\n      random_k05_object: 69.4\n      gap_R_minus_L2_k05_pp: 36.0\n      # Cross-suite L2norm/random gap at k=0.5\n      l2norm_k05_spatial: 55.6\n      random_k05_spatial: 71.6\n      gap_spatial_k05_pp: 16.0\n      l2norm_k05_goal: 59.8\n      random_k05_goal: 73.6\n      gap_goal_k05_pp: 13.8\n      l2norm_k05_long: 50.2\n      random_k05_long: 46.8\n      gap_long_k05_pp: -3.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      π0.5 \"uniformly critical\" 行为的 cross-suite 一致性验证了 Claim 1 和 Claim 5：\n      \n      1. **L2norm plateau 跨 suite 一致**：k≥0.85 时 L2norm 在所有 4 suites 维持高 SR\n         （Object 98%, Spatial 88.6%, Goal 88%, Long 78.4%）。Plateau 随 task complexity \n         轻微下降但保持>78%。机制：L2norm 的 deterministic selection 保留 spatial coverage，\n         low CV（0.055）使选中的 token subset 具有 near-uniform importance，覆盖度好。\n      \n      2. **Random cliff 跨 suite 差异化**：\n         - Object cliff dramatic（74→28→9→5%），因为 Object tasks 有 concentrated critical \n           tokens（object identity discrimination 依赖 specific patches）\n         - Spatial cliff milder（76→58→55→60%），因为 spatial layout information 是 \n           distributed 的，random removal 不会完全摧毁 spatial signal\n         - Goal cliff moderate（84→70→62→52%），因为 Goal tasks 混合了 spatial 和 \n           semantic disambiguation\n         - Long cliff steep（63→32→45%），因为 long-horizon compounding 放大了 random \n           token loss\n      \n      3. **Scaling law（Δ(R-L2)）cross-suite 演变**：\n         - Object k=0.5: +36.0pp（random wins massively, extreme of scaling law）\n         - Spatial k=0.5: +16.0pp（random wins, spatial distributed info helps random）\n         - Goal k=0.5: +13.8pp（random wins, similar to spatial）\n         - Long k=0.5: -3.4pp（L2norm slightly wins — long horizon 使 L2norm 的 \n           deterministic consistency 成为优势，random 的 per-step variance compounds）\n         \n         Gap 从 +36→+16→+14→-3.4 的变化不违反 scaling law：scaling law 是 \n         cross-model（CV drives direction），不是 cross-suite。Suite 影响 gap \n         magnitude 但不改变 sign（除 Long 的轻微 reversal，可解释为 horizon effect）。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: π0.5 L2norm plateau cross-suite\"\n        columns: [\"k\", \"Object\", \"Spatial\", \"Goal\", \"Long\"]\n        data:\n          - [\"1.0 (baseline)\", \"98.2\", \"97.2\", \"96.4\", \"92.8\"]\n          - [\"0.95\", \"98.2\", \"97.8\", \"90.8\", \"87.0\"]\n          - [\"0.925\", \"99.2\", \"97.0\", \"89.8\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"0.9\", \"98.2\", \"95.0\", \"90.6\", \"81.0\"]\n          - [\"0.85\", \"98.0\", \"88.6\", \"88.0\", \"78.4\"]\n          - [\"0.7\", \"55.0\", \"67.0\", \"73.6\", \"62.6\"]\n          - [\"0.5\", \"33.4\", \"55.6\", \"59.8\", \"50.2\"]\n          - [\"0.3\", \"51.0\", \"57.2\", \"50.6\", \"36.6\"]\n      - title: \"Table: π0.5 random cliff cross-suite\"\n        columns: [\"k\", \"Object\", \"Spatial\", \"Goal\", \"Long\"]\n        data:\n          - [\"0.95\", \"74.0\", \"76.4\", \"83.8\", \"63.2\"]\n          - [\"0.925\", \"27.6\", \"58.2\", \"70.0\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"0.9\", \"9.0\", \"54.6\", \"62.2\", \"31.8\"]\n          - [\"0.85\", \"5.0\", \"60.2\", \"52.4\", \"45.2\"]\n          - [\"0.7\", \"75.5\", \"74.4\", \"75.6\", \"65.8\"]\n          - [\"0.5\", \"69.4\", \"71.6\", \"73.6\", \"46.8\"]\n          - [\"0.3\", \"36.4\", \"43.4\", \"52.8\", \"29.6\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: π0.5 L2norm vs random pruning curves, 4 suites side-by-side. L2norm plateau vs random cliff contrast. Object cliff most dramatic, Spatial most resilient.\"\n      - \"Fig: Concentrated vs distributed critical tokens illustration — Object tasks show localized critical patches, Spatial tasks show diffuse importance.\"\n    analysis: >\n      π0.5 完整 cross-suite 数据确认了核心假设 3：uniformly critical behavior \n      generalize 至 Spatial/Goal，且机制一致（concentrated vs distributed critical tokens \n      决定 cliff severity）。pi05_l2norm_random_gap_k05_pp=36.0pp 落在 best tier \n      范围 [30, 40] 内。\n      \n      π0.5 是 scaling law 的 extreme point（CV=0.055, 最低），在所有 suite 上都展现\n      L2norm catastrophic failure at aggressive compression。这强化了 \"CV predicts optimal \n      pruning strategy\" narrative——对 low-CV models，importance-based pruning actively harmful。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 9. c3_oft_graded_full (planned)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"OpenVLA-OFT graded degradation cross-suite validation\"\n    plan_id: \"c3_oft_graded_full\"\n    description: >\n      OFT（7B, 3-layer MLP, DINOv2+SigLIP fusion, 512 tokens）在兼容硬件（A100+torch2.2）\n      上进行 4 suites baseline + pruning 评估。CV=0.219≈OpenVLA(0.215) 预测相同的 \n      graded degradation 模式。此实验验证 action head（OFT vs Standard）不影响 pruning behavior。\n    expected_results:\n      # Baselines (from official reports)\n      baseline_object: 97.0\n      baseline_spatial: 95.0\n      baseline_goal: 96.0\n      baseline_long: 85.0\n      # L2norm pruning (predicted from OpenVLA retention ratios)\n      l2norm_k095_object: 91.0\n      l2norm_k09_object: 83.0\n      l2norm_k07_object: 65.0\n      l2norm_k05_object: 50.0\n      l2norm_k03_object: 28.0\n      # Random pruning (predicted)\n      random_k095_object: 90.0\n      random_k09_object: 80.0\n      random_k07_object: 60.0\n      random_k05_object: 46.0\n      random_k03_object: 25.0\n      # L2norm vs random gap (high CV → L2norm slightly better)\n      gap_R_minus_L2_k05_object_pp: -4.0\n      gap_R_minus_L2_k07_object_pp: -5.0\n      # Cross-suite at k=0.9\n      l2norm_k09_spatial: 82.0\n      l2norm_k09_goal: 84.0\n      l2norm_k09_long: 68.0\n      # CV and entropy\n      cv: 0.219\n      entropy: 0.667\n    result_rationale: >\n      OFT 使用与 Standard OpenVLA 相同的 3-layer MLP connector。CV 0.219≈0.215 的高度一致性\n      预测几乎相同的 pruning degradation pattern：\n      \n      1. **Graded degradation 预测**：OpenVLA relative retention at k=0.5 = 37.4/74 = 50.5%。\n         OFT baseline 更高（~97%），absolute SR 更高但 relative pattern 一致。\n         预测 OFT k=0.5 L2norm ≈ 97×0.515 ≈ 50%。\n      \n      2. **L2norm > random 一致**：high CV（0.219）= meaningful importance differentiation → \n         L2norm selection effective。预测 L2norm 在所有 k 值优于 random 3-6pp，\n         与 OpenVLA pattern（+1.4 to +5.4pp）一致。\n      \n      3. **Cross-suite pattern**：OFT 的 512 tokens（vs OpenVLA 256）提供更高的信息冗余，\n         可能使 pruning tolerance 略高于 OpenVLA。但 connector mechanism 相同，\n         degradation shape 应一致（smooth graded）。\n      \n      4. **Action head 独立性**：OFT diffusion action head 和 Standard autoregressive \n         action head 对 pruning 的反应应 identical，因为 pruning 发生在 vision-LLM \n         接口而非 action decode 阶段。这是 connector-determines-pruning 假说的关键证据。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: OFT vs OpenVLA pruning comparison (Object suite, L2norm)\"\n        columns: [\"k\", \"OFT SR(%) (pred)\", \"OpenVLA SR(%)\", \"OFT retention\", \"OpenVLA retention\"]\n        data:\n          - [\"1.0\", \"97.0\", \"74.0\", \"100%\", \"100%\"]\n          - [\"0.95\", \"91.0\", \"69.4\", \"93.8%\", \"93.8%\"]\n          - [\"0.9\", \"83.0\", \"62.0\", \"85.6%\", \"83.8%\"]\n          - [\"0.7\", \"65.0\", \"49.0\", \"67.0%\", \"66.2%\"]\n          - [\"0.5\", \"50.0\", \"37.4\", \"51.5%\", \"50.5%\"]\n          - [\"0.3\", \"28.0\", \"20.6\", \"28.9%\", \"27.8%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: OFT vs OpenVLA pruning curves overlaid, normalized by baseline. Near-identical relative degradation pattern despite different baselines and action heads.\"\n    analysis: >\n      OFT 实验是 paper 中消除 confound 的关键 ablation：same connector + different action head \n      → same pruning behavior，证明 connector 是 causal factor。如果 Blackwell GPU \n      兼容性问题无法解决，OFT 可以仅通过 CV/entropy analysis（已完成）纳入 paper，\n      辅以 official baseline 引用。LIBERO eval 是 bonus（icing on the cake），\n      CV/entropy 已足够支持 Claim。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 10. c5_third_connector_roboflamingo (planned)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Perceiver Resampler connector fine-tune + pruning\"\n    plan_id: \"c5_third_connector_roboflamingo\"\n    description: >\n      RoboFlamingo（Perceiver Resampler: 64 learned query tokens 通过 cross-attention \n      attend to vision patches）在 LIBERO Object 上 fine-tune 后进行 pruning sweep。\n      验证第 4 种 connector family 的 pruning behavior。此前训练尝试因基础设施问题被 kill。\n    expected_results:\n      baseline_object_sr: 58.0\n      baseline_ci95: [53.5, 62.4]\n      # Pruning curve (L2norm)\n      l2norm_k095_sr: 52.0\n      l2norm_k09_sr: 42.0\n      l2norm_k07_sr: 22.0\n      l2norm_k05_sr: 10.0\n      # Pruning curve (random)\n      random_k095_sr: 50.0\n      random_k09_sr: 38.0\n      random_k07_sr: 18.0\n      random_k05_sr: 8.0\n      # Diagnostic\n      importance_cv: 0.22\n      entropy_ratio: 0.82\n      # Classification\n      connector_class: \"token-entangling (cross-attention)\"\n      pruning_pattern: \"steep graded → threshold at k≈0.7\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Perceiver Resampler 的 cross-attention 机制创造了中等程度的 token entanglement：\n      \n      1. **Entanglement 机制**：64 query tokens 各自通过 cross-attention attend 全部 vision \n         patches。每个 output token 不再对应特定 spatial region（unlike linear proj），\n         而是 learned mixture of all patches。但与 pixel-shuffle 不同，这种 mixture \n         是 learned 的且 query-specific，因此不同 query 可能 specialize to different \n         spatial/semantic aspects。\n      \n      2. **CV 预测 ~0.22**：介于 X-VLA（0.151）和 SmolVLA（0.314）之间。\n         Cross-attention 创造的依赖比 BART sequential mixing 更直接但不如 pixel-shuffle \n         的空间折叠极端。Query specialization 产生 moderate importance heterogeneity。\n      \n      3. **Pruning pattern 预测**：steep graded degradation。k=0.95 开始可见 drop \n         （~10% relative），k=0.7 显著下降（~60% relative），k=0.5 接近 collapse。\n         比 OpenVLA/MLP 更陡但不如 SmolVLA/pixel-shuffle catastrophic。\n      \n      4. **Baseline 预测 ~58%**：first-attempt fine-tuning on LIBERO，\n         RoboFlamingo original architecture 不是为 LIBERO 任务优化的。\n         合理的 mid-range SR。\n      \n      5. **L2norm ≈ random**：CV ~0.22 处于 L2norm 和 random 的交叉区域，\n         两种方法差异应 <5pp，类似 OpenVLA pattern。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: Perceiver Resampler pruning curve (predicted)\"\n        columns: [\"k\", \"Tokens kept\", \"L2norm SR(%)\", \"Random SR(%)\", \"Δ(R-L2)\"]\n        data:\n          - [\"1.0\", \"64\", \"58.0\", \"58.0\", \"0\"]\n          - [\"0.95\", \"61\", \"52.0\", \"50.0\", \"-2.0\"]\n          - [\"0.9\", \"58\", \"42.0\", \"38.0\", \"-4.0\"]\n          - [\"0.7\", \"45\", \"22.0\", \"18.0\", \"-4.0\"]\n          - [\"0.5\", \"32\", \"10.0\", \"8.0\", \"-2.0\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 4-connector family pruning curves on same axes — Linear (π0.5, flat), MLP (OpenVLA, gradual), Perceiver (RoboFlamingo, steep graded), Pixel-shuffle (SmolVLA, cliff). Continuous spectrum of pruning tolerance.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Perceiver Resampler 填补了 connector spectrum 的空白——在 MLP（graded）和 pixel-shuffle \n      （catastrophic）之间提供了第 4 个 data point。如果 CV ~0.22 且 pruning pattern \n      呈 steep graded，它将进一步验证 CV 作为 continuous predictor 的有效性。\n      \n      对 paper 的贡献：从 3 connector families 扩展到 4，增加了 paper 的 generalizability。\n      但即使此实验因基础设施问题未完成，paper 已有 5 models × 3 families 的充分覆盖，\n      Perceiver 可作为 future work 提及。在 best tier 下，此实验成功完成并增加 paper \n      的 reviewer 说服力。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 11. E5 attention-based pruning (implicit, not in plan YAML)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"E5 attention-based pruning — correct importance metric for entangling connectors\"\n    plan_id: \"e5_attention_pruning_xvla\"\n    description: >\n      X-VLA attention-based token pruning（last-layer / mean / rollout）在 4 suites 上验证。\n      核心发现：attention-based importance 在 entangling connector 上远优于 L2norm，\n      因为 attention 捕获了 BART encoder 创造的 cross-token dependencies。\n      已有数据覆盖 Object/Spatial/Goal/Long at k=0.5 和 k=0.3/k=0.7 部分点。\n      Goal suite 泛化已确认（SR=96.8-98.2% at k=0.5）。\n    expected_results:\n      # Object suite (confirmed)\n      attn_last_obj_k05: 99.2\n      attn_mean_obj_k05: 98.4\n      attn_rollout_obj_k05: 97.4\n      attn_last_obj_k07: 99.2\n      attn_last_obj_k03: 84.2\n      attn_mean_obj_k03: 96.0\n      attn_rollout_obj_k03: 92.0\n      # Spatial suite (confirmed)\n      attn_last_spatial_k05: 88.8\n      attn_mean_spatial_k05: 91.6\n      attn_rollout_spatial_k05: 92.8\n      attn_last_spatial_k03: 85.6\n      attn_mean_spatial_k03: 90.4\n      # Goal suite (confirmed — key best-tier assumption)\n      attn_last_goal_k05: 98.2\n      attn_mean_goal_k05: 97.4\n      attn_rollout_goal_k05: 96.8\n      # Long suite (confirmed)\n      attn_last_long_k05: 90.2\n      attn_mean_long_k05: 94.0\n      attn_rollout_long_k05: 94.8\n      attn_last_long_k05_seed43: 90.4\n      attn_mean_long_k05_seed43: 94.6\n      # vs L2norm comparison at k=0.5\n      l2norm_obj_k05: 42.6\n      attn_advantage_obj_k05_pp: 56.6\n      l2norm_goal_k05: 59.0\n      attn_advantage_goal_k05_pp: 39.2\n      l2norm_long_k05: 44.6\n      attn_advantage_long_k05_pp: 45.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      E5 attention pruning 成功的根本原因：attention weights 直接编码了 BART encoder \n      创造的 cross-token dependencies。L2norm 失败（特别是在 aggressive compression 下）\n      是因为 BART 使 token norms 近乎 uniform（CV=0.151），导致 L2norm selection \n      退化为 spatial clustering。而 attention weights 捕获了 decoder 实际需要哪些 token，\n      考虑了 cross-token 依赖关系。\n      \n      Cross-suite 一致性的原因：\n      - Object k=0.5 = 99.2%：简单任务 + attention guidance = near-perfect（仅需保留 \n        与 language instruction 相关的 object tokens）\n      - Goal k=0.5 = 98.2%：complex task 但 attention 正确识别了 multi-step 所需的 \n        critical tokens，消除了 task complexity amplification\n      - Long k=0.5 = 90.2%：最长 horizon，attention 仍能恢复大部分（vs L2norm 44.6%），\n        但 10pp gap vs baseline 来自 long-horizon compounding 的不可完全消除的 information loss\n      - Spatial k=0.5 = 88.8-92.8%：spatial tasks 需要 precise spatial token coverage，\n        attention 基本正确但不完美\n      \n      \"Correct importance metric rescues entangling connectors\" story：\n      X-VLA L2norm k=0.5 = 42.6% vs attention k=0.5 = 99.2% → +56.6pp。\n      这证明 pruning failure on entangling connectors 不是因为 information 不可保留，\n      而是因为 wrong importance metric。Attention-based pruning 是 correct metric。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: E5 attention pruning vs L2norm on X-VLA (k=0.5, all suites)\"\n        columns: [\"Suite\", \"Baseline\", \"L2norm SR(%)\", \"Random SR(%)\", \"Attn-last SR(%)\", \"Attn-mean SR(%)\", \"Attn advantage vs L2 (pp)\"]\n        data:\n          - [\"Object\", \"99.2\", \"42.6\", \"70.6\", \"99.2\", \"98.4\", \"+56.6\"]\n          - [\"Spatial\", \"93.0\", \"58.8\", \"71.4\", \"88.8\", \"91.6\", \"+30.0\"]\n          - [\"Goal\", \"98.4\", \"59.0\", \"67.2\", \"98.2\", \"97.4\", \"+39.2\"]\n          - [\"Long\", \"94.0\", \"44.6\", \"61.6\", \"90.2\", \"94.0\", \"+45.6\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: X-VLA pruning method comparison across 4 suites at k=0.5. Three bars per suite (L2norm, random, attention). Attention near-baseline everywhere, L2norm catastrophic on Object/Long.\"\n      - \"Fig: Attention advantage heatmap — rows=suites, columns=k values. Color intensity shows pp advantage of attention over L2norm. Hottest zones at aggressive k × complex tasks.\"\n    analysis: >\n      E5 是 best tier 的关键 complementary contribution。它证明：\n      1. Entangling connectors 的 pruning failure 是 metric failure，不是 fundamental limit\n      2. 正确的 importance metric（attention）can rescue X-VLA 至 near-baseline（99.2% at k=0.5）\n      3. Goal suite 泛化完美（98.2%），确认 assumption 5\n      4. 为 Diagnose-then-Compress framework 增加第三步：Diagnose（CV）→ Choose method \n         （attention for low-CV entangling, L2norm for high-CV independent）→ Compress（VTR if needed）\n      \n      Paper positioning：§4.7 或 supplementary，作为实用价值的补充。\n      不改变 primary contribution（2-axis framework + CV diagnostic），\n      但显著增强 method contribution 的完整性。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 12. CV-strategy scaling law final validation\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Scaling law cross-validation (k=0.5 and k=0.7, 3 models)\"\n    plan_id: \"c6_libero_suite_expansion\"\n    description: >\n      CV-strategy scaling law（Δ(R-L2) monotonically decreasing with CV）在 k=0.5 和 k=0.7 \n      已确认，无例外。Final validation 确保 remaining seeds 不引入 exceptions。\n    expected_results:\n      # k=0.5 scaling law (confirmed, no new exceptions)\n      pi05_delta_R_L2_k05: 36.0\n      xvla_delta_R_L2_k05: 26.9\n      openvla_delta_R_L2_k05: -1.8\n      spearman_k05: -1.0\n      # k=0.7 scaling law (confirmed)\n      pi05_delta_R_L2_k07: 22.2\n      xvla_delta_R_L2_k07: 6.5\n      openvla_delta_R_L2_k07: -5.4\n      spearman_k07: -1.0\n      # Absolute Spearman\n      cv_strategy_abs_spearman: 1.0\n      scaling_law_holds_both_k: true\n      new_exceptions: 0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Scaling law 在 k=0.5 和 k=0.7 均展示完美的 monotonic pattern（|ρ|=1.0）：\n      CV 越低（tokens 越 uniform），L2norm 越 harmful（因为 uniform distribution 上的 \n      norm-based selection 退化为 spatial clustering），random 越有优势。\n      \n      机制链：\n      CV=0.055（π0.5）→ near-uniform importance → L2norm clusters spatially → \n      catastrophic coverage loss → +36pp random advantage\n      \n      CV=0.151（X-VLA）→ moderate uniformity → L2norm partial clustering → \n      +27pp random advantage（smaller because BART creates some meaningful differentiation）\n      \n      CV=0.215（OpenVLA）→ meaningful differentiation → L2norm preserves important tokens → \n      -1.8pp（L2norm slightly better, importance-based selection effective）\n      \n      k=0.7 gap 小于 k=0.5 gap（22.2 vs 36.0 for π0.5）因为 k=0.7 保留更多 tokens，\n      spatial coverage loss 更轻。但 monotonic ordering 保持不变。\n      \n      Remaining seeds（已通过 multi-seed 确认）不会引入 exceptions：\n      - π0.5 L2norm k=0.5 dual-seed: 33.4/33.6（std=0.1pp）\n      - X-VLA random k=0.5 tri-seed: 70.6/71.0/69.2（σ=0.9pp）\n      - Gap reproducibility confirmed across all available seeds。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: CV-Strategy Scaling Law (dual k validation)\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"CV\", \"Δ(R-L2) k=0.5 (pp)\", \"Δ(R-L2) k=0.7 (pp)\", \"Direction\"]\n        data:\n          - [\"pi0.5\", \"0.055\", \"+36.0\", \"+22.2\", \"Random >> L2norm\"]\n          - [\"X-VLA\", \"0.151\", \"+26.9\", \"+6.5\", \"Random > L2norm\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"0.215\", \"-1.8\", \"-5.4\", \"L2norm >= Random\"]\n          - [\"SmolVLA\", \"0.314\", \"N/A (both 0%)\", \"N/A\", \"Method-independent\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Scaling law scatter plot — x=CV, y=Δ(R-L2). Two series (k=0.5 solid, k=0.7 dashed). Both monotonically decreasing. Crossover from random-advantage to L2norm-advantage at CV≈0.2.\"\n    analysis: >\n      |Spearman|=1.0 at both k values 落在 best tier 范围 [0.85, 1.0] 内（实际是上界）。\n      Scaling law 是 Claim 5 的核心，提供了 practitioner-facing 的 prescriptive guidance：\n      measure CV → if CV<0.15: use random pruning; if CV>0.2: use L2norm; \n      if 0.15<CV<0.2: either method works at mild compression。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"71bd17d0-2db3-4573-a2d4-98d47eafc079","total_cost_usd":2.1333594999999996,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":133744,"cache_read_input_tokens":801173,"output_tokens":31868,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":133744,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":16265,"cache_read_input_tokens":145436,"cache_creation_input_tokens":149,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":149},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":99993,"outputTokens":28,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.100133,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":8,"outputTokens":31868,"cacheReadInputTokens":801173,"cacheCreationInputTokens":133744,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":2.0332264999999996,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],